            {"stem": "What role will the wetland play?", "skill_focus": "detail", "evidence": "act as a natural holding area, absorbing water and slowing its flow", "explanation": "The wetland will hold and slow water.", "choices": [c("Absorb water and slow its flow", True, "This is the wetland's function."), c("Power the pumping station", False, "The wetland does not power the station."), c("Provide drinking water", False, "Drinking water is not mentioned."), c("Replace the road", False, "The road is separate.")]},
