            {"stem": "What approach does the speaker recommend?", "skill_focus": "purpose", "evidence": "It should compare attendance, access by income and age, and the value of swimming as a life skill.", "explanation": "The speaker recommends a broad comparison rather than a narrow financial choice.", "choices": [c("Compare access, attendance, and the value of swimming", True, "This is the recommended approach."), c("Choose the cheapest option", False, "The speaker warns against a single financial measure."), c("Close the pool immediately", False, "The speaker does not choose closure."), c("Build the indoor pool right away", False, "The speaker does not endorse one option.")]},
